 Welcome to The Ascmearc. Press ? for controls. The pass opens on the Ascmearc. Far to the east,
 Fyrbeorg smokes.




              ┌─ Maren's story ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
              │                                                                      │
              │  Who your parents were, nobody told you, and the woman who took you  │
              │  in for her own reasons would not say; you stopped asking. You came  │
              │  in a hard winter, when the river froze to its bed, and you came     │
              │  early and small.                                                    │
              │                                                                      │
              │  You were quick, and hard to catch, and oftener up a tree than at    │
              │  the table. You earned your keep at home, scrubbing floors and       │
              │  carrying water for the sick, and learned more of fevers than you    │
              │  wished to.                                                          │
              │                                                                      │
              │  No great grief found you, and you count that luck, as you should.   │
              │  Fortune never found your door; whatever you have, you got           │
              │  yourself.                                                           │
              │                                                                      │
              │  A letter came, in a hand you did not know, with a little money in   │
              │  it and three words: Come. There's work. At the top of the pass an   │
              │  old woman sat by a fire that should not have burned in that wind,   │
              │  and told you the ash march would make you or unmake you. She gave   │
              │  you bread for the road.                                             │
              │                                                                      │
              │ Enter continue                                                       │
              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘





